From 0c5ffd0b6ce722aae7ca12791389f6ab8ae98648 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Dobrianskyi <dobriansky777@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 19:57:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: add media mute toggle beside the QS volume slider

Use AudioService mute state to retain the active route volume instead of setting it to zero. Restore via the native toggle, keep fixed-volume and user restrictions, and add accessible themed controls with a 48dp touch target.

Change-Id: Ied7087d7de981a9edc05f9d2a2f2963818ae43f9
